          <foreground color="-16777216"/>
          <text value="I want to visit Taiwan but I just do not know what places to go. I’ve heard there are a lot of beautiful spots, from nature to night markets, but I’m not sure where to start. Can anyone recommend must-visit destinations, hidden gems, or local experiences? I’d love to know about both popular attractions and places that are off the beaten path."/>
